---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="WalStack Partner Kit | PostgreSQL Specialist" description="A printable overview of my free first PostgreSQL review for agencies and fractional CTOs.">
  <article class="container hero partner-kit">
    <h1>A first PostgreSQL review under your name.</h1>
    <p class="lede">I'm Kiran Sabne, an independent PostgreSQL engineer in Pune, India. If your client’s database is slow, I’ll do the first review free so you can inspect the work.</p>
    <h2>What to send</h2><p>Describe what got slower, when it started and where PostgreSQL runs. Your client can run my read-only snapshot script and remove sensitive details before sharing the output.</p>
    <h2>What you get</h2><p>I write three findings about what stands out, why it matters and what to check next. You keep the client relationship and decide how to present the findings.</p>
    <p><a href="/sample-report">See a report built on demo data</a>. <a href="/case-studies">Read the case studies I reproduced on generated data</a>.</p>
    <p><a href="/partners">First review for partners</a> · <a href={site.bookingUrl} data-track="book_call_click">Book a 15-minute call</a> · <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>
    <p class="actions"><a class="button" href="/downloads/walstack-partner-kit.pdf" download>Download the partner kit</a></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
